  "description": "Once a promising figure skater, Hong Gyu-Eon hung up his skates following a devastating injury and carved out a quiet second life as a chef. He thought he had left the ice and the heartache behind for good, until Seo Eun-Hyeong steps back into his world. Eun-Hyeong is the talented junior skater who vanished years ago, leaving behind parting words that felt more like a cruel curse than farewell advice. Gyu-Eon resolves to keep his guard up and push the prodigy away, but cold resentment quickly gives way to dangerous chemistry. The harder he tries to shut Eun-Hyeong out, the harder it becomes to look away.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
